  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped carrot and celery and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the smoked turkey neck and cook for 2-3 minutes on each side.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the Dutch velvety stew and chicken broth, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the stew to a boil, then cover and transfer to the oven.",
    "Bake at 300°F (150°C) for 2-3 hours, or until the meat is tender.",
    "Remove from the oven and serve hot."
